description = "The first time each combat Controller drops below {health_trigger%} health, it launches a pulse drone that detonates over the most enemies: enemies within {radius_cells} cells are stunned for {stun|cc} seconds, and allies there gain a {shield|shield} Shield for {shield_duration|shieldtime} seconds."
